{"unit_id":"yujh129__dsh-literature-agents#feature-paper-search","repo":"yujh129/dsh-literature-agents","commit":"a9447127083005fb8777317b176b0029a4f8763e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-literature-agents** 的功能「论文检索」：按主题、作者和年份范围并行查询 Crossref 与 OpenAlex，合并并去重题录；结构化来源无结果时可选用宿主网页搜索，并标注为未核验线索。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:996","sources.js:174"]}
{"unit_id":"yujh129__dsh-literature-agents#feature-biography","repo":"yujh129/dsh-literature-agents","commit":"a9447127083005fb8777317b176b0029a4f8763e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-literature-agents** 的功能「学人生平」：输入姓名或 Wikidata QID 查询人物生卒、籍贯、职业、教育等属性，并可列出 OpenAlex 匹配的著作，候选不确定时提示核对。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1121","sources.js:355"]}
{"unit_id":"yujh129__dsh-literature-agents#feature-classical-texts","repo":"yujh129/dsh-literature-agents","commit":"a9447127083005fb8777317b176b0029a4f8763e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-literature-agents** 的功能「古籍检索与阅读」：搜索中文维基文库的古籍页面并显示标题和摘要，再按页面标题读取清理后的正文；返回内容保留来源链接并可设置长度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1266","index.js:1333","sources.js:530"]}
{"unit_id":"yujh129__dsh-literature-agents#feature-translation","repo":"yujh129/dsh-literature-agents","commit":"a9447127083005fb8777317b176b0029a4f8763e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-literature-agents** 的功能「古籍翻译」：提交原文及可选出处，先查找维基文库平行材料，再交由古籍翻译专家生成今译或英译、注释和存疑说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1368"]}
{"unit_id":"yujh129__dsh-literature-agents#feature-citation-check","repo":"yujh129/dsh-literature-agents","commit":"a9447127083005fb8777317b176b0029a4f8763e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-literature-agents** 的功能「引用核验」：输入自由格式引文或 DOI，优先检查 Crossref DOI 记录；没有 DOI 时用 Crossref、OpenAlex 匹配题名并给出相似度和核实建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1470","sources.js:740"]}
